    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight <computeroutput>Status</computeroutput> result type for LLM Wiki plugin operations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Extracted from <computeroutput><ref refid="llm__wiki__plugin__interface_8h" kindref="compound">llm_wiki_plugin_interface.h</ref></computeroutput> so that low-level implementation headers (e.g., <computeroutput><ref refid="rocksdb__wiki__store_8h" kindref="compound">rocksdb_wiki_store.h</ref></computeroutput>) can include this single lightweight header without pulling in the full plugin interface (which transitively includes <computeroutput>llm/wiki_index_store.h</computeroutput> → TBB → CUDA).</para>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="llm__wiki__plugin__interface_8h" kindref="compound">llm_wiki_plugin_interface.h</ref></computeroutput> includes this header in place of its previous inline Status definition; callers who included <computeroutput><ref refid="llm__wiki__plugin__interface_8h" kindref="compound">llm_wiki_plugin_interface.h</ref></computeroutput> continue to get <computeroutput>Status</computeroutput> unchanged.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>0.1.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2026-08-26 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
